<%= page_heading "Not found", title: "Page not found" %>
<% content_for :robots, "noindex, follow" %>
<% content_for :description do %>
  This page does not exist. Browse the dog breeds and breed groups the Dog API
  serves, or read the API documentation.
<% end %>

<p>
  There is nothing at <code><%= request.path %></code>. It may have been a
  breed or a group that has since been renamed.
</p>

<p>
  From here you can browse <%= link_to "every breed", breeds_path %>, the
  <%= link_to "breed groups", groups_path %>, or read
  <%= link_to "the API docs", docs_path %>.
</p>
